# PRD2 Modernized — scope and documentation

This initiative is **OpenEMR Patient Dashboard modernization**: a Next.js presentation layer that consumes existing REST/FHIR APIs. It is **not** PRD 2 AgentForge Clinical CoPilot work (that stays under `interface/modules/custom_modules/oe-module-clinical-copilot/` and its Cursor rules).

## Work focus

- Deliverables and acceptance criteria: [Documentation/PRD2_MODERNIZED.md](Documentation/PRD2_MODERNIZED.md).
- Do **not** implement or extend AgentForge copilot flows in this track unless the user explicitly asks for that product.

## Code boundary

- **All** Next.js / Node dashboard code lives under [`frontend/`](frontend/) (App Router, auth, FHIR client, UI).
- **Do not** modify OpenEMR PHP business logic, database schema, or core monolith behavior to “support” the dashboard. Integration is via **published APIs and OAuth2/OIDC** only. See [Documentation/ARCHITECTURE_PRD2_MODERNIZED.md](Documentation/ARCHITECTURE_PRD2_MODERNIZED.md) §3 Out of Scope.

