## Git / upstream

- Primary integration branch for this track: **`prd2_af_modernized`** (topic branches branch from it).
- Treat **`master` as a mirror of `upstream/master`**. Refresh feature work by merging or rebasing `master` into the modernization branch after `git fetch upstream`; follow [docs/SYNC_DEV_WITH_UPSTREAM.md](../../docs/SYNC_DEV_WITH_UPSTREAM.md).
- **Never** push routine fork work to **`origin/master`**. **Never** push to canonical **[openemr/openemr](https://github.com/openemr/openemr)** unless you are explicitly executing an agreed-upon upstream contribution (default for this fork: do not push upstream).

